{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "7c42b0a4c00c856f7a283dc81db8c587f122870c9c2fa4ce9d2ab37872aced36", "ja": "迷宮からの脱出", "zh": "逃脱迷宫", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "df771ce4b9e83466b53801417698215f9d96fd6f7db2f625e840ba24a74a2210", "ja": "刑事役の百合子の誘いで、洋館からの脱出\nアトラクションにやってきた一同。自分が\n探偵役に向いているのか疑問を抱いていた\n紬だったが、百合子やまつりと話した事で、\n役との向き合い方を変える事ができた。", "zh": "在饰演刑警的百合子邀请之下，\n一行人来参加洋房主题的逃脱游戏。\n䌷原本怀疑自己是否适合侦探一角，\n但在跟百合子及茉莉谈过后，\n她改变了看待角色的方式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "92a84cd596c4cfe8052d1bde82e768594878716e830eb4e9c803739c5c0c3c20", "ja": "（今日は『屋根裏の道化師』に出演するメンバーと、\n洋館が舞台の脱出アトラクションにやって来た）", "zh": "（今天和演出《阁楼里的小丑》的成员\n一起来玩以洋房为舞台的逃脱游戏。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0d581475c5acfd98d3e7f4b5f977a490e84dbd6aa4f83ad278d577721f61c67f", "ja": "（仕事先でチケットをもらった百合子が、「イメージを\n膨らませるのに役立つかも」とみんなを誘ったんだが）", "zh": "（百合子在客户那边拿到门票，认为\n「也许可以刺激想像力」，于是就邀请大家。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "32227056bae64f2c0330cf1a4c7d1a9e53b5127ac14a76fa88f2bf7f92f64f96", "ja": "わぁっ……♪　不気味な洋館……\n血も凍るような事件……そして、謎めいた暗号……！", "zh": "哇……♪阴森的洋房……\n令人战栗的事件……还有充满谜团的暗号……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "d543007a6180ad4cb09df8c197f78e4b26d1f285f5221a077a495ad24b68d985", "ja": "まるで、推理小説の中に入り込んだみたいです！\nやっぱり来てよかった……！", "zh": "简直就像走进了推理小说里一样！\n来玩果然是正确的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9a6e182e34f8bdd8b73864f8caff1e7c06650147a8d81898f3f9ccde777f51e5", "ja": "ええ、驚きました。これを解くのが、探偵の仕事……。\nこんなこと、うちに務まるん……？", "zh": "的确十分惊人，而侦探的工作就是解开这样的谜团……\n人家真的做得来吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a2fb7cbd992c2a0ae072f8a3435459c1150bf8bf9ed502e8735794bf5f5daf0b", "ja": "紬？　どうかしたか？", "zh": "䌷？你怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "088db292a1555335c9303b8452571a0ebc5c6de21d9e155eabb12114a6c96845", "ja": "い、いえ。それより……田中さんと周防さんの\n予定が合わなかったのは、残念でしたね。", "zh": "没、没事。话说回来……\n田中与周防另有行程而无法前来，真是十分可惜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1007_p", "source_sha256": "656d61e56e96ca687a8b95612d30842a29748583fdf072460cfd5f4b765dc14c", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\nふたりとも、みんなによろしくって言ってたよ。", "zh": "嗯，对啊。\n她们要我代为向大家问好喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "7d1e9b13594c17194cdc5ae7e0a091c116d3eea6632e3c74ad4bd5912a0f5e1e", "ja": "ふたりとも、きっと大切な用事があったのです。\n……ね、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "她们俩一定是有很重要的事情吧。\n……呐，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1009_p", "source_sha256": "774624f3bdcbab4e9529c61bff2157cd104e624b7fdbdc185fe74b7ca0c56454", "ja": "うん、そう言ってたよ。", "zh": "嗯，她们是这么说的没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1010_p", "source_sha256": "bfa7452566d78e2cf5c4102590e22adf9085327f50328d6dab9a8fc51ede18fb", "ja": "（とはいえ、琴葉はなんだか後ろめたそうだったな……\n考えすぎだろうか？）", "zh": "（话虽如此，琴叶当时看起来有些内疚……\n是我想太多了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "8c934d0cb72d836c1b7f97cfd7b3abe29c0ae16f6dc8abb9b466a8990d9b5acc", "ja": "{$P$}、ちょっと手伝って～！\nここにカギがあるけど、手が、届かないの～っ！", "zh": "{$P$}，过来帮帮我～！\n这里有把钥匙，但我手构不到～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "7d497c31703f88ba7a2e02114129c99c1056907ac16b118c271552588a228270", "ja": "あとひとつで、カギがそろいそうです。\nクロスワードなら任せてください。……自信あり。", "zh": "再拿到一把钥匙应该就凑齐了。\n填字游戏就交给我吧……我有自信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a2816e001f03e987b6d67f3d89d0d86954f5b44604cc9d5addc3c2383c880e76", "ja": "わ、わかった、今行く！", "zh": "知、知道了，我这就过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3d2263dc8de9d9ecf42c8721515e25ce3ffee8994a54b581efa292694a2d75f4", "ja": "あの……七尾さんは、\n推理小説もたしなまれるのですか？", "zh": "那个……七尾，\n请问推理小说也在你的阅读范围吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "189b54f44597a2a8bd4b1697191c7a2a121d6385724f61d336789ffbface422e", "ja": "あっ、はい。大好きです！　特に、\n古い探偵小説の、ノスタルジックな雰囲気が……。", "zh": "啊，是啊，我很喜欢！\n尤其是以前的侦探小说有种怀旧的氛围……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "e4de673101d3fa7a28a0691304d46e5efe93f5bb6ab3c6b1b6853cfca3dea8ef", "ja": "今回の映画では、私は刑事の役ですけど。\n探偵役も、素敵ですよね！", "zh": "虽然我在这次电影饰演的是刑警，\n不过侦探的角色也很棒呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "360ad60586b37be46b71bdc9b5194b2b39a131494d2956107d318b2639893714", "ja": "あっ、でも犯人役も捨てがたいですよね！\nそれに被害者の役も、やってみたいですし……。", "zh": "啊，可是凶手角色也难以割舍！\n还有被害人，我也很想试试……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ba7d131496c2a830e9ff89ef00f6569fa8d71dd7767993970d040503ea53f12d", "ja": "えっ……ひ、被害者役も……ですか？", "zh": "咦……连、连被害人……也想演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "729bc6d9cfd914ee39928862777c207526a8edec480bd1e8d1e3ef14bc477568", "ja": "もちろんです！　サスペンスなら、絶対\nおいしい役だと思います！　ですよね、まつりさん？", "zh": "那当然啰！在悬疑作品之中，\n这样的角色是很吃香的！对吧，茉莉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1020_021mat", "source_sha256": "6e7aef87424229d167209d84b2d9a634da3d827b28f52e8c296c1bd4181192d2", "ja": "そうなのです。姫のびゅーてぃほー！な散りざまに\nファンのみんなはキラキラな涙を流してくれるのです。", "zh": "就是说的呀。\n公主美丽地凋落时，粉丝们一定会流下闪亮亮的泪水唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "bf7ca2ec85176df94e01dc1dd2043167e9653294de8f9f055892ae4d24e4d5a8", "ja": "姫は今からそれが、とーっても楽しみなのです♪", "zh": "公主现在就已经迫不及待了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "58e41af34d9d0dd893739a68b3d94270b7e5060c855d9c6f114f2cb6185cd163", "ja": "それに……誰かに殺されるなんて経験、\nお芝居以外ではできないと思うんです！", "zh": "而且……被人杀害的经验，\n除了演戏之外应该经历不到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1023_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1e228f7007cc0dd12c04f591d2388af4243014fd1b23492ec608302a3ef1cfd7", "ja": "はあ……そうですね。殺されてしまっては、\n体験もなにも残りませんし、伝えることも……。", "zh": "嗯……说得也是呢，毕竟要是真的被杀害，\n就不会留下任何体验，也无法传达想法了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1024_051tmg", "source_sha256": "37dd00f5d22a43b5431d14c4c9e6939d146550db395309a428894a9c3267a37c", "ja": "あ……。\nだから……そういうことなん……？", "zh": "啊……\n所以……就是这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1025_026yur", "source_sha256": "d9e00a3b34a18454b6bd86cedfa56b88044f2f8bde1c033c45e6e606873d509e", "ja": "そうなんですっ！　この映画を見てくれるお客さんは、\n私たちの体験を、自分のことみたいに感じるんです！", "zh": "没错！看了这部电影的观众，\n一定会对我们剧中的体验感同身受！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1026_026yur", "source_sha256": "ab7637f8fca5b49a5eb82a47e6ab1622aa892212da54af35ef0b210bb1a1cd9c", "ja": "そういう、普通じゃ絶対にできないことや\n起こらないことを体験できるのって、すごいですよね！", "zh": "可以体验到平时绝对办不到、\n不可能发生的事情，是不是很棒呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1027_021mat", "source_sha256": "142240ba00b6bcaec171fd13d68e40dffb9b09f4bada0b1523d824b4faca0c6a", "ja": "そうなのです。映画に出ている姫は、\nいつものフワフワな姫とは、別人なのです。", "zh": "就是这样的喔。\n电影里的公主，和平时轻飘飘的公主是不同人的唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "adb1dbd468f91d791fc9c0dc3483540b3afad06990197ced22b4dcab5aa07867", "ja": "読書やお芝居って、本当に素敵ですよね。そういう\nところが、いつも私の胸をときめかせてくれるんです。", "zh": "看书和演戏真的很棒呢，\n这样的体验总是让我内心雀跃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1030_026yur", "source_sha256": "a4553e52eb57bf15c4c63899fe5449418577a5f0246145423bfb403c1f06636f", "ja": "あっ！　ご、ごめんなさい、紬さん。\n私ったら、テンションが上がっちゃって……。", "zh": "啊！对、对不起，䌷。\n我也真是的，讲得太兴奋了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1031_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8df8d6e841813de978b0841ed67b2a4f74587fd2bb48be66b924ba0d4e7d57e7", "ja": "いいえ。あの……七尾さん。", "zh": "不会。那个……七尾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1032_026yur", "source_sha256": "12e3695c43db8839268359cd3df8995dd56474d7a45eaec04e64d4413f7e62be", "ja": "は、はい。", "zh": "什、什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1033_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7d653c350fd8e46a014f783e7528725042294665c72386cce7c2a592a787a736", "ja": "貴重なお話を、ありがとうございました。私……\n今のお話を聞いて、目からうろこが落ちた気分です。", "zh": "谢谢你与我分享如此宝贵的意见。\n我……听了你刚刚说的话，有如醍醐灌顶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1034_051tmg", "source_sha256": "414e9115db7c46aae495b60fcbd5f62ae0b4bb3460f093b1f0a1841df19bb372", "ja": "今日まで私は、自分のどこが探偵役に向いているの\nだろうと……そんなことばかり考えていました。", "zh": "直到今天，我都还在怀疑自己……\n究竟哪里适合饰演侦探角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1035_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6f277907a0b97f078da795408efdd1d6fe1fc339b983cf56908799e64700238d", "ja": "ですが……向くとか、向かないとか。\nそういう問題では、なかったのですね……。", "zh": "但是……其实这无关适不适合，\n问题并不在这里，对吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1036_026yur", "source_sha256": "cc551b0dd67813e0ff2c2f36dc43374cb615e58194ba44dcba282bfe3ed69dfc", "ja": "いっ、いえ、そんな！　私、そんな偉そうなこと\n言える立場じゃないですし……。", "zh": "不、不会，你太客气了！\n我也没有立场对你指教啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1037_026yur", "source_sha256": "4cf146a311944907ea2232ff234afa4b4c3970b8b662d926b6285f143d74c3ee", "ja": "でも、せっかくのお芝居ですから。\n一緒に楽しめたらいいですね！　刑事と探偵で！", "zh": "不过，难得有机会参与这出戏，\n我们一起好好享受吧！以刑警和侦探的身分！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1038_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7c1fac7ece05c635834b827d11c0445de4b0b26b9eeb57baf6e083712fb9f289", "ja": "……はい。", "zh": "……好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1039_021mat", "source_sha256": "0f226448b5dff562d93964937e2f40de9e9b3d543e1d479b8bffba3cf92fbedd", "ja": "わんだほー！　姫も百合子ちゃんや紬ちゃんと\nお芝居するの、と～っても楽しみなのです。", "zh": "太美妙了～！公主也很～期待\n和小百合子跟小䌷一起演戏的唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1040_p", "source_sha256": "05762297c9634f83aa6d85a79400eb4925a825777acbaa9384c1116d8d88677c", "ja": "（紬は少し、肩の力が抜けたみたいだな。\nやっぱり来てよかったってことか）", "zh": "（䌷好像稍微放松点了，\n来这里玩果然是正确的吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1041_p", "source_sha256": "4ca5ab2f2373111a78a20bd917412c4794856989031de30891c4032f7748c73b", "ja": "（その後、ゲーム自体も成功。全員で、脱出できた。\n最後の謎は、まつりがいつの間にか解いていた）", "zh": "（之后，逃脱游戏也成功破解了，大家全都逃了出来。\n最后的谜题是茉莉不知何时解开的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_03_1042_p", "source_sha256": "7f3c411a72db69f040b820f17fbcfc08a192b9f0a7965f65f59d5a33cef8fa39", "ja": "（撮影開始も近づいてきたが……\nこの調子で、上手くいくといいな！）", "zh": "（距离开拍也越来越近了……\n希望可以继续顺利进行下去！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
